Z||000001||Indiana_resto_guy||04-26-2001||06:30 PM||||If your standing on the passenger side of the car looking at the front of the engine, you will see from rear to front, the EGR valve solenoid (vacuum tubes attached to it), the thermostat housing then the oil pressure switch. If the plug is in one piece it is a large ring that you need to squeeze the sides to remove.||||reg||1
